WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,780 --> 00:00:02,780
There are so many turtle bombs in the sleeping area

2
00:00:02,780 --> 00:00:06,290
This thing is big

3
00:00:06,290 --> 00:00:08,290
It is said to have a replenishing effect

4
00:00:08,290 --> 00:00:10,290
Because of this feature, its sales are very good

5
00:00:10,290 --> 00:00:26,570
Seventy-eight Americans are getting rich this time

6
00:00:26,570 --> 00:00:29,570
Turtles were listed as first-class protected animals in 1986

7
00:00:29,570 --> 00:00:31,570
In the same year, the state also promulgated regulations

8
00:00:31,570 --> 00:00:33,570
It is strictly prohibited to collect and use turtle bombs

9
00:00:33,570 --> 00:00:35,570
It's only 1980

10
00:00:35,570 --> 00:00:37,570
Turtle bombs can still be bought and sold

11
00:00:37,570 --> 00:00:44,560
And the price is not low

12
00:00:44,560 --> 00:00:46,560
These things can be reduced at Houhai Village Beach

13
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:48,560
Since I have traveled thousands of miles to an isolated island

14
00:00:48,560 --> 00:00:50,560
I just came here for the big stuff.
